-all: prepare $(KO_LIST) $(OTHERS)
+# RNSBox: the original `all` target builds the Cvitek out-of-tree
+# multimedia kernel modules (vcodec/jpeg/tpu/vi/vpss/dwa/rgn/vo/ive/cif/…),
+# every one of which is camera-IPC code with hard deps on ION + dma-buf
+# kernel symbols that we strip for the router build. None of these .ko
+# files are loaded by any RNSBox boot script, so dropping them is a
+# pure win — image gets ~5 MB smaller and `build_osdrv` stops blocking
+# the build. Original line saved below.
+# all: prepare $(KO_LIST) $(OTHERS)
+# RNSBox W variant: build ONLY the wireless (AIC8800) ext driver, still
+# skipping all the camera/codec KO_LIST modules. `wireless` + the
+# `cp_ext_wireless` copy step are gated on CONFIG_CP_EXT_WIRELESS=y in the
+# board defconfig; if that's unset these targets do nothing harmful.
+all: prepare wireless cp_ext_wireless
 
